{"total":10,"start":1,"num":25,"nextStart":-1,"results":[{"id":"1e623a6606464c609053b25994dbc67e","owner":"gispublisher_PEC","created":1784141983000,"modified":1790257093000,"guid":null,"name":"Parcel","title":"Parcel Boundaries","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":"<p>This dataset contains polygon features representing property parcel boundaries within the County of Prince Edward, Ontario.<\/p><p>The parcel layer is maintained by Prince Edward County GIS for municipal mapping, planning, infrastructure management, emergency response, taxation reference, and general land-use analysis. The dataset is derived from available cadastral mapping sources and may incorporate information from provincial parcel datasets, survey fabric data, and municipal updates.<\/p><p>The boundaries represent an interpreted municipal parcel fabric and are provided for mapping and reference purposes only. They should not be interpreted as legal survey boundaries or used to determine legal property ownership. Official ownership information and legal parcel descriptions are maintained through the Ontario Land Registry system and Teranet land records.<\/p>","tags":["Prince Edward County","County of Prince Edward","PEC Open Data","Open Data","Parcels","Parcel Boundaries","Property Boundaries","Land Parcels","Cadastral Data","Cadastre","Property Mapping","Municipal Base Data","Land Information","Ontario","Property and Land"],"snippet":"Property parcel boundaries for the County of Prince Edward, Ontario, maintained by Prince Edward County GIS for municipal mapping, analysis, and reference.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1784143983560.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-77.61958098009774,43.82936793473825],[-76.57996013756262,44.19031059275777]],"categories":["/Categories/Boundaries"],"spatialReference":"2149","accessInformation":"The Corporation of the County of 