eatures___Property_Info","title":"HostedFeatures _ Property Info","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<div><b> This hosted feature layer contains property and addressing reference data for Prince Edward County. <\/b><\/div><div><br /><\/div><div><b>Included layers:<\/b><\/div><div>- Site Structure Address Points - Unfiltered<\/div><div>- Parcels <\/div><div><br /><\/div><div><b>The Site Structure Address Points layer is the unfiltered NG9-1-1 addressing source used to support civic addressing, emergency response mapping, municipal addressing workflows, web maps, and related GIS applications. The layer may be duplicated and filtered within web maps to separate Entrance Points from other site structure address point designations.<\/b><\/div><div><br /><\/div><div>The parcel layer provides property reference context for municipal mapping, analysis, planning review, and operational workflows.<\/div><div><br /><\/div><div>The service is maintained by Prince Edward County GIS and shared through the County\u2019s ArcGIS data pipeline using one-way distributed collaboration.<\/div><div><br /><\/div><div><b>Spatial reference:<\/b><\/div><div>- Projected Coordinate System: NAD 1983 CSRS UTM Zone 18N<\/div><div>- Projection: Transverse Mercator<\/div><div>- WKID: 2959<\/div><div>- Linear Unit: Metres<\/div><div><br /><\/div><div><b>This dataset is intended for authorized GIS mapping, civic addressing, property reference, emergency response support, and operational use.<\/b><\/div>","tags":["Prince Edward County","PEC","property info","property reference","parcels","parcel data","Site Structure Address Points","SSAP","unfiltered SSAP","Entrance Points","site points","NG911","NG9-1-1","civic addressing","addressing","address points","emergency response","municipal addressing","planning review","municipal GIS","NAD 1983 CSRS UTM Zone 18N","WKID 2959",